{"id":"n29667-1-17","stage":0,"title":"걷다 · 走","scene":"生活与经历","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n29667-1-17-1","ko":"회사에는 버스를 타고 다니세요?","zh":"您平时坐公交车去上班吗？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"회사에는","meaning":"去公司","explanation":"회사：公司；-에 表示去往地点，-는 标记话题或对比。","readings":[{"term":"회사","audio":"/audio/a109dcd7f6f11c2e1703.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"31668","senseId":"1","lemma":"회사","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"회사에는","audio":"/audio/e638dca6f7ecd615e8d7.mp3"}},{"text":"버스를","meaning":"公共汽车，公交车","explanation":"버스：公共汽车，公交车；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"버스","audio":"/audio/fb84fa7f86eac62eca5f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"36678","senseId":"1","lemma":"버스","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"버스를","audio":"/audio/4ab439d0845f5096c8da.mp3"}},{"text":"타고","meaning":"乘坐","explanation":"타다：乘坐；-고 与后面的 다니다 连用，表示以公交车为交通方式。","readings":[{"term":"타다","audio":"/audio/8f835109fdc29a59b6ab.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17160","senseId":"1","lemma":"타다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"타고","audio":"/audio/8aebcd33801f792f7638.mp3"}},{"text":"다니세요?","meaning":"上下班吗","explanation":"다니다：定期往返于公司或学校；-세요? 是礼貌敬语问句。","readings":[{"term":"다니다","audio":"/audio/02309ed22c9c36273e57.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29702","senseId":"3","lemma":"다니다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"다니세요","audio":"/audio/9414e8a6500bcd50e0a6.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"a109dcd7f6f11c2e","term":"회사","zh":"公司","audio":"/audio/a109dcd7f6f11c2e1703.mp3","entryId":"31668","definition":"从事事业活动的组织；这里是上班的地点。","pronunciation":["회ː사","훼ː사"]},{"id":"fb84fa7f86eac62e","term":"버스","zh":"公共汽车，公交车","audio":"/audio/fb84fa7f86eac62eca5f.mp3","entryId":"36678","definition":"收取费用、按照规定路线行驶、可乘坐多人的大汽车。","pronunciation":[]},{"id":"8f835109fdc29a59","term":"타다","zh":"乘，乘坐","audio":"/audio/8f835109fdc29a59b6ab.mp3","entryId":"17160","definition":"坐到交通工具或当作交通工具的动物背上。","pronunciation":["타다"]},{"id":"02309ed22c9c3627","term":"다니다","zh":"定期往返、上班","audio":"/audio/02309ed22c9c36273e57.mp3","entryId":"29702","definition":"定期往返于公司或学校；这里指上下班。","pronunciation":["다니다"]}],"audio":"/audio/7e8a8ecff246da8f1aa2.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n29667-1-17-2","ko":"아니요. 요즘은 살을 빼려고 걸어서 다닙니다.","zh":"不是。最近为了减肥，我都走路上班。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"아니요.","meaning":"不是","explanation":"아니요：礼貌地否定前面“坐公交车上班吗”的问题。","readings":[{"term":"아니요","audio":"/audio/9474acc7539b7e2cedaf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17189","senseId":"1","lemma":"아니요","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"아니요","audio":"/audio/9474acc7539b7e2cedaf.mp3"}},{"text":"요즘은","meaning":"最近，近来，这阵子","explanation":"요즘：最近，近来，这阵子；은：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"요즘","audio":"/audio/828c4030dd68aa7bc886.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"20250","senseId":"1","lemma":"요즘","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"요즘은","audio":"/audio/e48ea92a2eef5b38ed37.mp3"}},{"text":"살을","meaning":"身上的肉（与体重有关）","explanation":"살 指人身上的肉；살이 찌다 是长胖，살이 빠지다 是变瘦，살을 빼다 是减重。这里不是梳子齿、年龄或皮肤义。","readings":[{"term":"살","audio":"/audio/d804a5a98c800c56a6e4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66883","senseId":"1","lemma":"살","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"살을","audio":"/audio/52da6c8617f35997f4c4.mp3"}},{"text":"빼려고","meaning":"为了减肥","explanation":"살을 빼다：减肥；-려고 表示意图，即“为了减肥”。","readings":[{"term":"빼다","audio":"/audio/2a9a5583b5aa17960d82.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"85714","senseId":"9","lemma":"빼다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"빼려고","audio":"/audio/9228ee61cd98ced0188d.mp3"}},{"text":"걸어서","meaning":"走路","explanation":"걷다：步行；-어서 在这里连接移动方式，걸어서 다니다 是“走路上下班”。","readings":[{"term":"걷다","audio":"/audio/82e3bb1b27351e4d45ed.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29667","senseId":"1","lemma":"걷다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"걸어서","audio":"/audio/ccc311521d028aa1de80.mp3"}},{"text":"다닙니다.","meaning":"上班","explanation":"다니다：定期往返于公司；-ㅂ니다 是正式礼貌的陈述句末。","readings":[{"term":"다니다","audio":"/audio/02309ed22c9c36273e57.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29702","senseId":"3","lemma":"다니다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"다닙니다","audio":"/audio/94b16c1bccaf668cc2f8.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"9474acc7539b7e2c","term":"아니요","zh":"不是","audio":"/audio/9474acc7539b7e2cedaf.mp3","entryId":"17189","definition":"礼貌地否定对方提出的问题。","pronunciation":["아니요"]},{"id":"828c4030dd68aa7b","term":"요즘","zh":"最近，近来，这阵子","audio":"/audio/828c4030dd68aa7bc886.mp3","entryId":"20250","definition":"从非常近的过去到现在之间。","pronunciation":["요즘"]},{"id":"d804a5a98c800c56","term":"살","zh":"身上的肉（与体重有关）","audio":"/audio/d804a5a98c800c56a6e4.mp3","entryId":"66883","definition":"身上的肉（与体重有关）","pronunciation":["살"]},{"id":"2a9a5583b5aa1796","term":"빼다","zh":"减肥，减重","audio":"/audio/2a9a5583b5aa17960d82.mp3","entryId":"85714","definition":"使肥肉或体重等减少。","pronunciation":["빼ː다"]},{"id":"82e3bb1b27351e4d","term":"걷다","zh":"走，行走，步行","audio":"/audio/82e3bb1b27351e4d45ed.mp3","entryId":"29667","definition":"在地上交替着抬起并移动脚，改换位置。","pronunciation":["걷ː따"]},{"id":"02309ed22c9c3627","term":"다니다","zh":"定期往返、上班","audio":"/audio/02309ed22c9c36273e57.mp3","entryId":"29702","definition":"定期往返于公司或学校；这里指走路上班。","pronunciation":["다니다"]}],"audio":"/audio/7c108a0b0b5171412f67.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":1.94,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=29667","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"초급","day":27,"sequenceScore":1.1672,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["不是。最近为了减肥，我都走路上班。","学校什么时候开学的？","您平时坐公交车去上班吗？"],"answer":2},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["不是。最近为了减肥，我都走路上班。","您平时坐公交车去上班吗？","学校什么时候开学的？"],"answer":0}]}
